WEBVTT

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:30.996
And it was just show and tell.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.566
And people shared all kinds
of interesting things.

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:36.235
AG: One woman who is very
detail oriented in her memos

00:10:36.259 --> 00:10:38.556
had been seen as a little nerdy.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:41.606
She shared photos of herself
training for a marathon.

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:45.240
It turned out she'd qualified
for the US Olympic team at one point.

00:10:45.264 --> 00:10:48.280
She saw herself as an athlete,
not just a researcher,

00:10:48.304 --> 00:10:51.044
which was something her colleagues
could then see as well.

00:10:51.068 --> 00:10:53.082
Another guy had served in the Marine Corps

00:10:53.106 --> 00:10:54.779
and came off a bit stoic.

00:10:54.803 --> 00:10:56.317
He shared photos of his mom

00:10:56.341 --> 00:10:58.630
and talked about
how she was a source of strength

00:10:58.654 --> 00:11:01.216
when he was afraid
he wouldn't survive a mission.